{"resourceIdentifier":"5574","resourceName":"WEIFANG YOURAN DAIRY CATTLE MANURE MANAGEMENT PROJECT","description":"Weifang Youran Dairy Cattle Manure Management Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) is located in the north of Zoumaling Village, Binhai Economic and Technological Development Zone, Weifang City, Shandong Province, China. This project is owned and implemented by Weifang Youran Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd.\r\nThis project utilizes the waste such as cow manure and urine generated from the newly built 12000 cow pasture of Youran Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd. as raw materials, and adopts the medium temperature CSTR anaerobic fermentation process to construct a comprehensive utilization project for manure. The biogas is used for biogas heating boilers and biogas power generation systems. The electricity generated by the biogas generator unit is used for the project's own use, and the heat energy is used for anaerobic system warming and insulation. After solid-liquid separation, the sludge is air dried and reused as cow mattress material. This project not only develops biomass energy, effectively utilizes resources, but also reduces environmental pollution caused by aquaculture, improves the ecological environment, and achieves sustainable development of modern aquaculture.\r\nThe emission reductions from electricity generation and heating will not be accounted for. \r\nThe project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas. The project is expected to achieve an annual emission reduction of 44,446 tCO2e and a total emission reduction of 311,122 tCO2e during the first 7-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":36.978887,"longitude":119.212777},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-06-11","endExclusive":"2025-07-12","endInclusive":"2025-07-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5574"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Weifang Youran Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shandong, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 18947126889"},{"type":"string","value":"yanfeng0303@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"45908"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"07/04/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 10/11/2023 - 09/11/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=132051&IDKEY=80e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9j182098329","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"PD-V01-20250511.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-20T13:38:24.383Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=132052&IDKEY=3q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhD182099708","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"LR.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-20T13:40:09.193Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=148367&IDKEY=skjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909l204598093","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PDMR 5574 - RD1. clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2026-04-07T08:34:14.997Z"},{"uri":